  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/08/IMG_4829.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Este lunes han comenzado las exhibiciones de vaquillas y toros en las fiestas del barrio San Joaqu&iacute;n, en Onda, con reses de la ganader&iacute;a El Mijares. Por la noche ha habido dos emboladas a ambos extremos de la calle San El&iacute;as.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdillunssantjoaquim13/img_4704.jpg\" alt=\"img_4704\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdillunssantjoaquim13/img_4705.jpg\" alt=\"img_4705\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdillunssantjoaquim13/img_4706.jpg\" alt=\"img_4706\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdillunssantjoaquim13/img_4708.jpg\" alt=\"img_4708\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdillunssantjoaquim13/img_4709.jpg\" alt=\"img_4709\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdillunssantjoaquim13/img_4710.jpg\" alt=\"img_4710\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdillunssantjoaquim13/img_4711.jpg\" alt=\"img_4711\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdillunssantjoaquim13/img_4712.jpg\" alt=\"img_4712\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdillunssantjoaquim13/img_4714.jpg\" alt=\"img_4714\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.